<title>USA: Southern Peru Copper Corp Q1 net higher.</title>
<headline>Southern Peru Copper Corp Q1 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in millions, except for per share data)</p>
<p>						    1997	     1996</p>
<p> Sales					   $214.8	  $196.4</p>
<p>Earnings before taxes on income and</p>
<p>    minority interest			  77.2	    77.4</p>
<p> Taxes on income				 19.8	    26.3</p>
<p> Earnings before minority interest	 57.4	    51.1</p>
<p>Minority interest  in income of</p>
<p>    Peruvian Branch			     1.6	     2.0</p>
<p> Net earnings				    55.8	    49.1</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>     shares outstanding			80.2	    80.2</p>
<p> Net earnings per share			0.70	    0.61</p>
<p>NOTE: Company is 54.1 pct owned by ASARCO Inc and 13.9 percent owned by Phelps Dodge Corp.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
